<title>THAILAND: Finance One posts big Q1 net loss.</title>
<headline>Finance One posts big Q1 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			(in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1997			     1996</p>
<p>Consolidated</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss     11.13	vs    profit     1.53</p>
<p>    Net	   loss  4,608.08	vs    profit   632.63</p>
<p>Unconsolidated</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	9.06	vs    profit     1.19</p>
<p>    Net	   loss  3,752.09	vs    profit   491.67</p>
<p>Note: Results are reviewed. Company's full name is Finance One Plc, a major finance company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
